<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>高祖兵山水画廊</title><link>https://gaozubing.cn/</link><description>Recent content on 高祖兵山水画廊</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 26 Nov 2025 23:47:00 +0900</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://gaozubing.cn/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>山水乐居</title><link>https://gaozubing.cn/albums/%E5%B1%B1%E6%B0%B4%E4%B9%90%E5%B1%85/</link><pubDate>Wed, 26 Nov 2025 23:47:00 +0900</pubDate><guid>https://gaozubing.cn/albums/%E5%B1%B1%E6%B0%B4%E4%B9%90%E5%B1%85/</guid><description>整幅画以俯瞰式大场景展开，层峦重叠、构图开阔，显得气势充盈而不压迫。山体以淡褐和青绿交替染色，层次柔和，呈现一种“天地初开、云海散尽”的辽阔感。
中部梯田最为亮眼，线条简练却富节奏感，与远处的悬崖平台相呼应，构成整幅画的视觉核心。山谷间的亭台与屋舍点缀在青绿之间，带来生活的温度，让这幅山水不仅是景色，更像理想居所的缩影。
近景松树与红叶相互映照，为画面加上几分雅致与季节感。留白的云雾穿梭在山间，让空间更显通透。
这幅作品的意境为：山中有田、水畔有居，生活有序，天地自安。
寓意家宅兴旺、环境和美、事业稳固、人生有“退可守、进可攻”的从容。
适合挂在客厅、茶室、酒店、会客空间或任何需要营造“山中雅境”的场合。</description></item><item><title>山居人家</title><link>https://gaozubing.cn/albums/%E5%B1%B1%E5%B1%85%E4%BA%BA%E5%AE%B6/</link><pubDate>Wed, 26 Nov 2025 23:46:00 +0900</pubDate><guid>https://gaozubing.cn/albums/%E5%B1%B1%E5%B1%85%E4%BA%BA%E5%AE%B6/</guid><description>&lt;no value></description></item><item><title>山高水长</title><link>https://gaozubing.cn/albums/%E5%B1%B1%E9%AB%98%E6%B0%B4%E9%95%BF/</link><pubDate>Wed, 26 Nov 2025 23:44:00 +0900</pubDate><guid>https://gaozubing.cn/albums/%E5%B1%B1%E9%AB%98%E6%B0%B4%E9%95%BF/</guid><description>&lt;no value></description></item><item><title>寻山问春</title><link>https://gaozubing.cn/albums/%E5%AF%BB%E5%B1%B1%E9%97%AE%E6%98%A5/</link><pubDate>Wed, 26 Nov 2025 23:43:00 +0900</pubDate><guid>https://gaozubing.cn/albums/%E5%AF%BB%E5%B1%B1%E9%97%AE%E6%98%A5/</guid><description/></item><item><title>风起云涌</title><link>https://gaozubing.cn/albums/%E9%A3%8E%E8%B5%B7%E4%BA%91%E6%B6%8C/</link><pubDate>Wed, 26 Nov 2025 23:40:00 +0900</pubDate><guid>https://gaozubing.cn/albums/%E9%A3%8E%E8%B5%B7%E4%BA%91%E6%B6%8C/</guid><description>&lt;no value></description></item><item><title>寻芳</title><link>https://gaozubing.cn/albums/%E5%AF%BB%E8%8A%B3/</link><pubDate>Wed, 26 Nov 2025 23:37:00 +0900</pubDate><guid>https://gaozubing.cn/albums/%E5%AF%BB%E8%8A%B3/</guid><description>&lt;no value></description></item><item><title>傲雪红梅</title><link>https://gaozubing.cn/albums/%E5%82%B2%E9%9B%AA%E7%BA%A2%E6%A2%85/</link><pubDate>Wed, 26 Nov 2025 23:31:00 +0900</pubDate><guid>https://gaozubing.cn/albums/%E5%82%B2%E9%9B%AA%E7%BA%A2%E6%A2%85/</guid><description/></item><item><title>云壑听松声</title><link>https://gaozubing.cn/albums/%E4%BA%91%E5%A3%91%E5%90%AC%E6%9D%BE%E5%A3%B0/</link><pubDate>Wed, 26 Nov 2025 22:04:00 +0900</pubDate><guid>https://gaozubing.cn/albums/%E4%BA%91%E5%A3%91%E5%90%AC%E6%9D%BE%E5%A3%B0/</guid><description>&lt;no value></description></item><item><title>柳暗花明处</title><link>https://gaozubing.cn/albums/%E6%9F%B3%